<title>ARGENTINA: Fiat 'pens $600 mln plant in Argentina.</title>
<headline>Fiat 'pens $600 mln plant in Argentina.</headline>
<dateline>BUENOS AIRES 1996-12-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Italian automaker Fiat SpA on Friday opened a new $600 million plant in Argentina as part of its strategy to make customs union Mercosur a key market for its vehicles.</p>
<p>The plant in Cordoba province, 700 km (400 miles) northwest of Buenos Aires, will have an initial capacity of 120,000 vehicles per year, which will rise to 200,000 at a later stage.</p>
</text>
